-        4.  Advance the ray:
-            $$
-            \begin{aligned}
-            \text{ray\_length} &\leftarrow \text{ray\_length} - \text{step\_length} \\
-            \text{position} &\leftarrow \text{position} + \text{step\_vector}
-            \end{aligned}
